{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KeYzgSsCB61793710813.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞冠精英盃，上海海港作客，以4-2擊敗紐卡素噴射機。</p><p></p><p>紅衫海港由李安納度頂中楣底入網，23分鐘領先1-0。3分鐘後，噴射機的阿基連拿「擺烏龍」，海港拉開2-0。亦是半場比數，換邊後安佩姆窄位射入，51分鐘擴大優勢到三球，頭三輪勝、和、負各一。</p><p></p><p>噴射機則三連敗，並失15球，冠絕分組賽，柏德列活特，回敬窄位入球，58分鐘追成1-3，80分鐘，貝頓些路射入，進一步追近至2-3，但始終要各項賽事十場不勝。</p><p></p><p>上海海港憑後備的李新翔86分鐘，球不著地射入，贏4-2，取得分組第二場勝利。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.777340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:59:39.127591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:39.546088+00:00","content_hash":"e80c353ed5bafc663f86a24d095ef1b273dae9c285d8849c6de87d89e9fb2f8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.777340+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}